            "review_title": "Review at Majestic Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Allan D\n13 contributions\n0\nTop Quality\nFeb 2020\nWe eat at the restaurant on our first evening in Ho Chi Minh. We were the only people in the restaurant which was disconcerting, We are not familiar with Vietnemese cuisine so we did not know what to order or how many courses, and the waiter could not speak sufficient English to assist us.\nWhat we ordered was excellent and very well presented. I think had we have had more understanding of the cuisine, we would have been better prepared.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 24, 2020",
