            "review_title": "Review at Majestic Restaurant",
            "review_text": "David D\nAdelaide, Australia889 contributions\n3\nSoak up the atmosphere\nNov 2019 • Friends\nAfter dinner elsewhere, we decided to go the Majestic roof top bar for coffee and a few wines. If nothing else, enjoying a slight breeze, sipping wine while gazing over the river is one of life’s little joys. We didn’t eat but the coffee was good and the wine acceptable. But you should good for the experience and imagine what this grand old lady has seen over the years. That’s what makes this place 5 stars!\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2019",
