            "review_title": "Review at Majestic Restaurant",
            "review_text": "jerry t\nVenice, Florida318 contributions\n0\nHistoric rooftop bar\nSep 2019 • Friends\nThink Graham Greene, The Quiet American, war corespondents, journalists, military, Bar girls and hangers on congregating at the rooftop bar to drink, trade lies and watch the artillery battles across the Saigon River at night. Can’t see across the River now because of the new high rises, but the spirit remains the same. Drinks are still cold and reasonable, the band still rocking sixties American rock and roll. Worth the nostalgia!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2019",
