            "review_title": "Review at Majestic Restaurant",
            "review_text": "G.\nAustralia267 contributions\n1\nSunset Drinks and Dinner - Rooftop AMAZING\nSep 2018\nOhhhhhh THAT VIEW! Have your camera ready guys....This is one of a handful of MUST DO Rooftop experiences. Come just before dusk and watch the beautiful skyline of HCMC come to life in amazing colours and lights as daylight fades and nightfall elbows her way in. There are stunning views in 180 degree + directions. Not only is this spot an historic landmark architecturally in the city (think Quiet American, News Correspondents, Graham Greene, French Infantry wartime baracks, et al) but it is an incredible place to sit and have a bite, write a few socials (or postcards!), enjoy sumptuous cocktails and - in my case - listen to incredible live music performed wonderfully by a trio at no extra charge and adding such a memorable layer to an already \"bucket-list\" experience.\n\nHIGHLY RECOMMEND/MUST DO\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 15, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
