            "review_text": "BobWE\nManhattan Beach, California735 contributions\n0\nGreat Rooftop Bar\nMar 2019 • Couples\nSitting on the Saigon River harbor location in the Majestic Hotel is a delightful rooftop bar overlooking on the eight Floor of the Majestic Hotel. Live music to accompany the wonderful views from the eighth floor of the hotel make this a great location for a view of the harbor front portion of the city. While there enjoy a \"Happy Saigon\" cocktail their signature drink invented in the 1920s. Happy hour reduces the price of the drinks by half between 4 and 6pm. A classy place!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 16, 2019",
