            "review_title": "Review at Majestic Restaurant",
            "review_text": "groovereviewer\nLondon, United Kingdom42 contributions\n0\nOld world charm with all modern amenities in a great location\nFeb 2019\nWe only stayed for a couple of nights at the end of our trip so didn't get a chance to fully check out all the amenities that the hotel has to offer, however everything we did experience was great. The location, right on the banks of the Mekong is fantastic... minutes walk from lots of great places to eat, drink and explore. The room was clean, comfortable and quiet (even though we overlooked the main riverside road) with a balcony overlooking the river. The staff were helpful, friendly and accommodating and able to answer all our requests. The roof-top bar was a great spot for cocktails in the evening, with live music and a friendly vibe and breakfast (the only meal I had there) was comprehensive as well as tasty (big bonus points for having marmalade too!). I would definitely recommend a stay here and would return if I make it back to Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 7, 2019",
